া তোমাদের মান্য করেছে", "fa": "از شما اطاعت کردند"}}, {"arabic": "أَطَاعَ", "count": 1, "first": "4:80", "audio": "audio/a449ebad8950fbcaff43.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it obeyed", "bs": "poslušao je", "tr": "itaat etti", "fr": "il a obéi", "id": "dia telah taat", "ur": "اُس نے اطاعت کی", "bn": "সে মান্য করেছে", "fa": "اطاعت کرد"}}, {"arabic": "أَطَعْتُمُوهُمْ", "count": 1, "first": "6:121", "audio": "audio/2f41cf6f441c9aa94710.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": ["hum"]}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) obeyed them", "bs": "poslušali ste ih", "tr": "onlara itaat ettiniz", "fr": "vous leur avez obéi", "id": "kalian telah menaati mereka", "ur": "تم سب نے ان کی اطاعت کی", "bn": "তোমরা তাদের মান্য করেছ", "fa": "از آنان اطاعت کردید"}}, {"arabic": "وَيُطِيعُونَ", "count": 1, "first": "9:71", "audio": "audio/f51a3892f0d065a0b90a.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "and they obey", "bs": "i slušaju", "tr": "ve itaat ederler", "fr": "et ils obéissent", "id": "dan mereka taat", "ur": "اور وہ اطاعت کرتے ہیں", "bn": "এবং তারা মান্য করে", "fa": "و اطاعت می‌کنند"}}, {"arabic": "وَأَطِيعُوٓا۟", "count": 1, "first": "20:90", "audio": "audio/fd3ad9c65ef1660c7486.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "and (you all) obey!", "bs": "i poslušajte!", "tr": "ve itaat edin!", "fr": "et obéissez !", "id": "dan taatlah kalian!", "ur": "اور تم سب اطاعت کرو!", "bn": "এবং তোমরা মান্য কর!", "fa": "و اطاعت کنید!"}}, {"arabic": "أَطَعْتُم", "count": 1, "first": "23:34", "audio": "audio/942a208ca6da2f05ed2b.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "(ako) poslušate", "en": "(if) you obey", "tr": "(eğer) itaat ederseniz", "fr": "(si) vous obéis